# Line endings.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) and deployed into a
# Linux container. Most files do not care. These do: a CRLF in a Dockerfile
# RUN line, an nginx config or a shell script is a syntax error or a silently
# wrong string on the other side, and it is invisible in every editor.
#
# `text eol=lf` pins the working-copy form too, so the bug cannot be
# introduced by a checkout rather than by a commit.
* text=auto

Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.conf          text eol=lf
*.template      text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.toml          text eol=lf
.dockerignore   text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
